<p. 40>

{cinmantramālinī}

atha pañcadaśanityānāṃ upasanākramolikhyate (-) pratipadārabhyaparvāntaṃ 
krameṇa kāmeśvaryādicitrītaṃ tattattithau tadvidyāṃ ghaṭikṣara krameṇaṇaṣṭi 
saṃkhyājapan sandhyātraye'pi kuryāt | tadyathā (-) 

prātaḥsnāna velāyāṃ tattadvidyāṃ tri japtvā apaḥpītvā tattadvidyā 
japtvādbhirātmānaṃmabhiṣicyāṃtrya pūrvaṃ vastrayaradhāna 
saṃdhyāvaṃdhanādikaṃ kṛtvā śucau deśe svagṛhe vā mṛdulāsane 
prāṅmukhaḥ upaviśya padmāsanaḥ san prāṇāyāma bhūtaśuddhyādikaṃ 
kṛtvā karpūravāsitāṃgārako bhūtvā svaśirasiguruṃdhyātvā 
prīṇayitvānamaskṛtyamātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā prathamāyāṃ tithau 
śrīmahātripurasundarī prītikāmo'haṃ kāmeśvarī nityā vidyājapaṃ kariṣye | iti 
saṃkalpya aiṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ sakalahrīṃ śirase svāhā | 

<p. 41>

nityāśikhāyaivaṣaṭkinne kavacāya huṃ | madradrave netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | sauḥ 
astrāya phaṭ | evaṃ karāṅgayorvinyasya aiṃ sakalahrīṃ iti netrayoḥ nitya iti 
śrotrayoḥ klinna iti nāsikāyāṃ jihvāyāṃ hṛdi i nābhauve guhyesauḥ iti 
sarvāṃgeṣu sthāneṣvekaikamevaṃvinyasya samastena vyāpakaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyet |

bālārkakoṭisaṅkāśāṃ māṇikyamakuṭojjvalām |
hāragraiveyakāñcībhirūrmikānūpurādibhiḥ |

maṇḍitāṃ raktavasanāṃ raktābharaṇa śobhitām |
ṣaḍbhujāṃ tryakṣaṇāmindukalākalitamaulikām |

pañcāṣṭaṣoḍaśadvandvaṣaṭkoṇa caturaśragām |
mandasmitalasadvaktrāṃ dayāmanthara vīkṣaṇām |

pāśāṃkuśe ca puṇḍrekṣu cāpāṃ puṣpaśilīmukhām |
ratnapātrasīthupūrṇaṃ varadaṃ bibhratī karaiḥ |

evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ kṛtvā yathā saṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā punaḥ 
ṣaḍaṅgān vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | mūlamantraṃ aiṃsakalakahrīṃ 
nityaklinnemadadravesauḥ | ayaṃ kāmeśvarīmūlamaṃtraḥ | 

dvitīyāyāṃ pūrvavat prātaḥ snānādikaṃ kṛtvābhagamālinīvidyāṃ japet | 
guruvandanādi mātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā | aiṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ bhagabhagāvahe 
astrāya phaṭ | evaṃ karāṅgayoḥ vinyasya samastena vyāpakaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyet 
aruṇāmaruṇākalpāṃ sundari susmitānanāṃ trinetro bāhubhiḥ ṣaḍbhirūpetāṃ 
kamalāsanīkalhāra pāśapuṇḍrekṣukedaṃḍānnāmabāhubhiḥ dadhānāṃ 
dakṣiṇaiḥ padmamaṃkuśaṃ puṣpasāyakān tathāvidhābhiḥ 

<p. 42>

parito vṛtīśaktigaṇaiḥ stutām |

evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvā yathā saṅkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā punaḥ 
ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt || aiṃ bhagabhugebhāgeni bhagodare 
bhagamāle bhagāvahe bhagaguhye bhagayoni bhaganipātinī sarvabhagavaśaṃkarī 
bhagarūpe nityaklinne bhagasvarūpiṇī sarvāṇi bhagāni mehyānayavaraderetesurete 
bhagaklinnekledaya drāvaya amoghe bhagavicce kṣubhakṣobhaya sarvasatvān 
bhageśvarī aiṃ llūṃ jñeṃ vlūṃ peṃ llūṃ moṃ vlūṃ aiṃ klinnesarvāṇi 
bhagānimevaśamānaya svāhā strīṃharaleṃ hrīṃ iti bhagamālinīmantraḥ ||

tṛtīyāyāṃ pūrvavatprātaḥsnānādikaṃ vidhāya nityaklinnāvidyāṃ japet | 
guruvandanādi mātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā hrīṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ nityāśirase 
svāhā | klinne śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | madakavacāyahum | drave netratrayāya vauṣaṭ 
svāhā astrāya phaṭ |

aruṇā maruṇā kalpāṃ maruṇāṃ śukadhāriṇīṃ aruṇasrāgvilepāṃ ca 
cārusmeramukhāmbujam |

netratrayollayadvaktrāṃ phālagharmāṃvumauktikaiḥ |
virājamānāṃ mukuṭa lasadardhenduśekharām |
caturbhirbāhubhiḥ pāśamaṃkuśaṃ pātrakaṃkaraiḥ |
abhayaṃ bibhratīṃ padmamadhyāsīnāṃ madālasām ||
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvāsaṃkalpitaṃ japam |

kṛtvā | punaḥ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | hrīṃ nityaklinne 
madadrave svāhā iti nityaklinnāmūlamantraḥ |

catuthyāṃ pūrṇavatsnānādikaṃ kṛtyaṃ vidhāya guruvandanādi 
mātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā krāṃhṛdayāya namaḥ | hraiṃ śirase svāhā | krauṃ 
śikhāyai 

<p. 43>

hrauṃ kavacāya huṃ cchrauṃ netratrayānvitāṃ jrauṃ astrāya evaṃ 
karayorvinyasya taptakāñcanasaṅkāśāṃ hāranetratrayānvitām |
cārusmitānvitamukhīṃ divyālaṅkārabhūṣitām ||

tāṭaṅkahārakeyūraraktavastravibhūṣitām |
vasanā nūpurormyādi bhūṣaṇairati sundarām ||

pāśāṃkuśau carmakhaḍgau gadāvanhidhanuḥśarān |
karairdadhānāmāsīnāṃ pūjayāmyanyathā sthitām ||

evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvā saṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā punaḥ ṣaḍaṅgāni 
vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt || oṃ krauṃ hrauṃ krauṃ chrauṃ jrauṃ svāhā iti 
bheruṇḍāmantraḥ ||

pañcamyāṃ pūrvavat snānādikaṃ vidhāya guruvandanādimātṛkānyāsaṃ 
kṛtvā hrāmityādiṣaḍaṅgaḥ |

taptakāñcanasaṃkāśāṃ navayauvanasundarām |
cārusmeramukhāṃbhojāṃ vilasannayanatrayām |
aṣṭabhirbāhubhiryuktāṃ māṇikyābharaṇojjvalām |
raktābjakaṃ ca puṇḍrekṣu cāpa cāpa pūrṇendumaṇulām |
dadhānāṃ bāhubhirvāme kalhāraṃ hemabhṛṅgakam |
puṣpeṣu mātuluṅgaṃ ca dadhānāṃ dakṣiṇaiḥ karaiḥ |
svaramānābhirabhitaḥ śaktibhiḥ parivāritām ||

evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvāsaṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā 
punaḥ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt |

|| oṃ hrīṃ vahnivāsinyai namaḥ iti vanhivāsinīmantraḥ ||

ṣaṣṭhyāṃ pūrvavatsnātvā snānādikaṃ vidhāya mahāvidyeśvarīvidyāṃ japet |

<p. 44>

guru vandanādi mātṛkā nyāsaṃ kṛtvā hrīṃ klīṃ neṃ hrīṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ 
| hrīṃ aiṃ hlīṃ śrīṃ śirasi | hrīṃ krauṃ hrīṃ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ hrīṃ nitya hrīṃ 
kavacāya | hrīṃ mada hrīṃ netra hlīṃ drave hrīṃ astrāya |

raktāṃ raktāṃbarāṃ raktagandhamālāvibhūṣitām |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ māṇikyamakuṭojjvalam ||

pāśāṃkuśācikṣucāpaṃ dāḍimīsāyakaṃ tathā |
tadhānī vāhubhirnerdayā madasuśītalām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvā saṃkalpitaṃ japam |
kṛtvā punaḥ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vidhāya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt ||

hrīṃ klinne aiṃ krauṃnitya madadrave hrīṃ iti mahāvidyeśvarī mantraḥ |
saptamyāṃ pūrvavatprātaḥ snānādikaṃ vidhāya guruvandanādimātṛkānyāsaṃ 
vidhāya hrāḥ ityādi ṣaḍaṅgaḥ | nidāghakāla madhyānhadivākara samaprabhām |
 
navaratnakirīṭāñca tryakṣaṇāmaruṇāṃvarām |
navābharaṇasaṃpannāṃ dehakānti virājitām |
śucismitāmaṣṭabhujāṃ stūyamānāṃ maharṣibhiḥ | 
pāśaṃ kheṭaṃ ṭaṅkadharāṃ caṣakaṃ vāma bāhubhiḥ |
dakṣiṇairaṃkuśaṃkhaḍgaṃ kuṭhāraṃ kamalaṃ tathā ||

dadhānāṃ sādhakābhīṣṭadānodyamasamanvitām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvā saṃkalpitaṃ japam |
kṛtvā samarpya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | hrīṃ śivadūtyai namaḥ |

iti śivadūtī mantraḥ |

aṣṭamyāṃ pūrvavatsnānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvandanādi mātṛkānyāsaṃ 
kṛtvā sve ca hṛdayāya ce che śirasechekṣā śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | kṣastrīṃ 
kavacāya 

<p. 45>

strīṃ haṃ netratrayāya haṃ khakṣeṃ astrāya phaṭ | evaṃ karāṅgayornyāsaḥ 

śyāmavarṇāṃ śubhakārā navayauvanaśobhinīm |
dvitrikramādṛṣṭabhāgaiḥ kalpitābharaṇojjvalām |
tāṭaṃkamegadaṃ tadvadraśanā nūpurānvitaiḥ |
vipra kṣatriyaviṭa śūdrājātibhirbhīmavigrahām |
vallavāṃśukasaṃvītāṃ śikhipiñchakṛtaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
calayairbhūṣitabhujāṃ māṇikyamakutojjvalam |
barhibarhakṛtāṃcūḍāṃ tatpatrā tatpatākinīm |
guñjāguṇalasadvakṣaḥkucāṃ kuṃkumamaṇḍitām |
trinetrāṃ cāruvadanāṃ mandasmitamukhāṃbujām |
pāśāṃkuśavarānmīti lasadbhuja catuṣṭayām ||

evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvā saṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya 
śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | oṃ hrīṃ huṃ khe ca che kṣa strīṃ haṃ kṣeṃ hīṃ phaṭ 
iti tvaritā | aṅganyāsaṃ kṛtvā 

lohitāṃ lohitāṃgāra śaktivṛndaniṣevitām |
lohitāṃ śukabhūṣāsrak lepanāṣaṇmukhāṃbujām |
prativaktratrinayanāṃ tathā cārusmitānanām |
anarghyaratnaghaṭitamāṇikkamukuṭojjvalām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ badhvāsaṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya śrī 
vidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ iti kula sundarī mantraḥ ||

daśamyāṃ prātaḥ snānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvaṃdanamātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā 
hyāmitiṣaḍaṃgaṃ kṛtvā (-) 

udyadbhāskarasaṃkāśāṃ māṇikyamakuṭojjvalām |
padmarāga kṛtākalpāmaruṇāṃśukadhāriṇīm |

<p. 46>

pramādāt parityaktaḥ nātragranthapātaḥ 

<p. 47>

cārusmitalasadvaktrapadvaroja virājitam |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvā saṅkalpitaṃ japam 
kṛtvā samarpya śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt |

hasakalaraḍaiṃhasakalaraṇḍīhasakalaraḍauḥ iti nityāmantraḥ ||

ekādaśyāṃ prātaḥsnānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvandanamātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā 
hrīṃ phreṃ hṛdayāya sktaṃ kroṃ śirase svāhā āṃklīṃ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | aiṃ 
vlūṃ kavacāya hum | nityamadadrave netratrayāya kṣeṃ preṃ hrīṃ astrāya || 
indranīlanibhāṃ bhāsvanmaṇimaulivirājitām 

pañcavaktrāṃ trinayanāṃ maruṇāṃśuka dhāriṇīm |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvāsaṃkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya 
śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt |

hrīṃ phreṃ sruṃ kroṃ āṃklīṃ aiṃ vlūṃ nityamadadravehuṃpheṃhīṃ iti 
nīlapatākāmantraḥ |

dvādaśyāṃ prātaḥ snānādikaṃ vidhāya guruvandanamātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā 
bhāṃ hṛdayāya bhe śirase ī śikhāyai kṣeṃ yaiṃ kavacāya oṃ netratrayāya vau 
eva maṅganyāsaḥ |

pañcavaktrāṃ daśabhujāṃ prativaktraṃ trilocanām |
bhāsvanmukuṭavinyasta candrarekhā virājitām |
śaṅkhaṃ kheṭañcapāśau kalhāraṃ vāmabāhubhiḥ |
cakraṃ tathāṅkuśaṃ khaḍgaṃsāyakaṃmātuluṅgakam |
dadhānā dakṣiṇairhastaiḥ saumyāṃ caiva sukhāsanām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvāsaṅkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya śrī 
vidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt |

<p. 48>

hrīṃ phreṃ sruṃ kroṃ āṃ klīṃ aiṃ vlūṃ nitya madadrave huṃ pheṃ hāṃ iti 
nīlapatākāmantraḥ 

bhamaraya auṃ oṃ iti vijayāmantraḥ ||

trayodaśyāṃ prātaḥ snānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvandanaṃ mātṛkānyāsaṃ 
vidhāya sāmidiṣaḍaṅgaḥ |

suvarṇa varṇaṃ rucirāṃ muktāmāṇikyabhūṣitām |
māṇikya makuṭāṃ netradvaya preṃkha ṭhappāparāṃ |
dvibhujāṃ svāsanāṃ padmetvaṣṭa poḍaśatadvaye |
patrairupete sa caturdvārabhrūsadmayugme |
nātuliṃgaphalaṃ dakṣe dadhānāṃ karapaṅkaje |
vāmena nijabhaktebhyaḥ prayacchantīṃ dadhanādikam |
svasamānābhirabhitaḥ śaktibhiḥ parivāritām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvā saṅkalpitaṃ japam |
kṛtvā sarmārtha śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt | svauḥ iti sarvamaṅgalā mantraḥ |

caturdaśyāṃ prātaḥ snānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvandanaṃ mātṛkānyāsaṃ 
vidhāya oṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ śirase svāhā bhagavati śikhāyai jvālāmālinī 
kavacāya huṃ devī netratrayāya sarvabhūtasaṃhārake astrāyajvalanasaṅkāśāṃ 
māṇikkamakuṭojjvalām |

ṣaḍvaktrāṃ dvādaśabhujāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
pāśāṅkuśau khaṭakhaḍgau cāpabāṇau gadādharau |
śūlaṃ vahnivarābhītidadhānāṃ karayaṃkajaiḥ |
svasamābhirabhitaḥ śaktibhiḥ parivāritām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvāsaṅkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya 
śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt |

<p. 49>

oṃ namo bhagavati jvālāmālini devi sarvabhūtasaṃhārakārike jātavedase jvalaṃtī 
jvala jvala prajvalaprajvala hrāṃ hrīṃ hrūṃ ra ra ra ra ra ra ra jvālāmālini huṃ phaṭ 
svāhā | iti jvālāmālinīmantraḥ |

pañcadayāṃ paṃcadaśyāṃ prātaḥ snānādikaṃ kṛtvā guruvaṃdanādi 
mātṛkānyāsaṃ vidhāya cāmityādiṣaḍaṅgaṃ kṛtvā(-)

udyadādityabiṃbābhāṃ navaratnavibhūṣitām |
navaratnakirīṭañca citrapaṭṭāṃśukomalām |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ śucismitalasanmukhām |
sarvānandamayīṃ nityāṃ samastasitadāyinīm || (stepsi>

caturbhujāṃ bhujaiḥ pāśamaṃkuśaṃ varadābhaye |
dadhānāṃ maṅgalāṃ padmāṃ karṇikānavayonigām |
evaṃ dhyātvā yonimudrāṃ baddhvāsaṅkalpitaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya 
śrīvidyopāsanaṃ kuryāt ||

ktvauṃ iti citrāmūlamantraḥ | kādimate tu śuklekṛṣṇepi 
pratipadādipañcadaśyantaṃ kāmeśvaryādi citrāntaṃ krameṇa tattattithau 
tattannityābhajanaṃ kuryāditi niyamaḥ | tasmāttāsāṃ nyāsa mantradhyānāni 
likhitāni | pañcadaśanityāśca paradevatāṃśabhūtatvāttāsāṃ ṛṣicchandasī 
mūladevatā tadyathā dakṣiṇāmūrti ṛṣiḥ paṅktiścchandraḥ kāmeśvarī nityā 
devatā yathā tathā kuryāt iti vat tattannāmnā kuryāditi upadeśakramaḥ |

<p. 50>

[iti śrī prakāśānanda viracitāyāṃ cinmantramālinyāṃ nityopāsanākramaḥ 
samāptaḥ] 

saṃvat (1719)

